<node id="SMB Share">
  <data key="d0">SMB Share</data>
  <data key="d1">PreconditionEnvironment</data>
  <data key="d2">A network share used for file and printer sharing within a Windows Active Directory environment.&lt;SEP&gt;A shared network folder accessible for credential phishing or lateral movement.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5b62addae42b2d3e684b41ed40260e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e3971755d02df1ca9d73a71e46dde1d7-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">barbhack-2025-ctf-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-logging-methodology.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1785756840</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Windows Active Directory">
  <data key="d0">Windows Active Directory</data>
  <data key="d1">TechnologyStack</data>
  <data key="d2">Windows Active Directory is a directory service used by Microsoft Windows to centrally manage user and group accounts, authentication, and network resources within enterprise environments. It serves as a foundational directory service and centralized authentication infrastructure, enabling efficient policy enforcement, permission delegation, and secure user access to shared resources such as SMB shares and domain resources across the network.&lt;SEP&gt;A directory service that stores user accounts and manages security policies on Windows hosts.&lt;SEP&gt;The Active Directory service running on a Windows host for user, group, and policy management.&lt;SEP&gt;Microsoft directory service infrastructure present in the target environment.&lt;SEP&gt;On-premise directory and authentication infrastructure used for user and group management within an enterprise environment.&lt;SEP&gt;Microsoft's directory service for domain user management and centralized authentication.&lt;SEP&gt;Active Directory domain services providing user and group authentication.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5b62addae42b2d3e684b41ed40260e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-abae2141b512784d1f09780ffa398a5d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9d1d825cd69dea8aed6d1651fb993c0c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d193154c13a7545340d6aac7f93551ff-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-db51747d6e1553794dcbbc6d673eb1a6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-136da9e7ebc65a69c7a4923c2daacd7b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ccb6aa44b59c087ddbe71de229597bd4-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ccb6aa44b59c087ddbe71de229597bd4-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce55c93390355c438aad3e42f2558ea0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66bd77b51f9ea38a4762d65732ac21c9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66bd77b51f9ea38a4762d65732ac21c9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a267c575fd1175171a41707a2ac80c03-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8047b6c93b09b89977542720f829a1da-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a539186415b267cf2fe68e024581d476-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e3971755d02df1ca9d73a71e46dde1d7-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a18d9206e0b44dc082a257441a96e79d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff53209713af43febf0054a8036e08a1-chunk-000</data>
