<node id="WebDAV Path">
  <data key="d0">WebDAV Path</data>
  <data key="d1">PreconditionEnvironment</data>
  <data key="d2">A network protocol and file system enabling file upload operations typically found in file managers or document handling interfaces.&lt;SEP&gt;A writable WebDAV directory accessible locally for file uploads, sync operations, or persistence.&lt;SEP&gt;A URL or filesystem path supporting Web Distributed Authoring and Versioning protocol, enabling file manipulation via HTTP.&lt;SEP&gt;A writable WebDAV endpoint accessible for document uploads or web server interaction.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5b62addae42b2d3e684b41ed40260e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d193154c13a7545340d6aac7f93551ff-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b35a43e83892d75bc8e3746466c2bcfc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28e61b57c4ef53155963a0bdc0146d46-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e3971755d02df1ca9d73a71e46dde1d7-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">barbhack-2025-ctf-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-barrier-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-guardian-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-logging-methodology.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1785756840</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Upload Handler">
  <data key="d0">Upload Handler</data>
  <data key="d1">PreconditionEnvironment</data>
  <data key="d2">An endpoint or service designed to accept and process file uploads from a user or application.&lt;SEP&gt;A component or endpoint on the server responsible for receiving and processing file uploads.&lt;SEP&gt;An interface accepting file uploads, with disclosed storage or web-serving behavior.&lt;SEP&gt;An endpoint or component capable of receiving and writing uploaded files to disk or filesystem paths.&lt;SEP&gt;A component or endpoint designed to accept and process uploaded files from a client.&lt;SEP&gt;An endpoint designed to receive file uploads from a client.&lt;SEP&gt;A web application component that accepts user-uploaded files or data for server-side processing.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5b62addae42b2d3e684b41ed40260e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dd80fa5ebb19e9944238770f478851fb-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d193154c13a7545340d6aac7f93551ff-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce55c93390355c438aad3e42f2558ea0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28e61b57c4ef53155963a0bdc0146d46-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e3971755d02df1ca9d73a71e46dde1d7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4cbd3a65e3bbf220a047cbb226753147-chunk-000</data>
