<node id="JWT Token Forgery">
  <data key="d0">JWT Token Forgery</data>
  <data key="d1">AttackTechnique</data>
  <data key="d2">JWT Token Forgery is the act of creating, modifying, or exploiting JSON Web Tokens to impersonate legitimate users or circumvent authorization checks within a system. It involves generating malicious tokens containing false claims or forged digital signatures that successfully validate against the issuer or relying party, thereby enabling unauthorized access or privilege escalation. While this technique can be employed intentionally for security testing purposes to evaluate the effectiveness of authentication and authorization controls, when executed maliciously it represents a critical vulnerability in systems depending on JWTs for access management. Attackers who exploit this method generate or tamper with counterfeit JSON Web Tokens to bypass bearer token authentication controls or inject falsified data into valid tokens, allowing them to operate as authenticated users without possessing legitimate credentials. This is achieved by exploiting implementation flaws, weaknesses in the handling of secret keys, or insufficient token validation flows.&lt;SEP&gt;Technique that constructs or modifies JSON web tokens to impersonate a user or bypass authorization checks due to secret weakness or flow flaws.&lt;SEP&gt;A method involving creating or modifying valid-looking JSON Web Tokens to impersonate users, elevate roles, or bypass session checks.&lt;SEP&gt;Technique to craft or alter JSON Web Tokens to impersonate an authenticated user.&lt;SEP&gt;A method for creating fraudulent JSON Web Tokens to impersonate a legitimate user within the application.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5b62addae42b2d3e684b41ed40260e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5b62addae42b2d3e684b41ed40260e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dd80fa5ebb19e9944238770f478851fb-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dd80fa5ebb19e9944238770f478851fb-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d193154c13a7545340d6aac7f93551ff-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d193154c13a7545340d6aac7f93551ff-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-db51747d6e1553794dcbbc6d673eb1a6-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-db51747d6e1553794dcbbc6d673eb1a6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d57f4dccb7b1de7c796c24d456b2c90f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-39047a18b515fcf5a6bcfa50dda4ee3a-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d8a71a5db941f76cbd976ed319daa4ce-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5b3691250d8034efc538f45153325e82-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ccb6aa44b59c087ddbe71de229597bd4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ccb6aa44b59c087ddbe71de229597bd4-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce55c93390355c438aad3e42f2558ea0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66bd77b51f9ea38a4762d65732ac21c9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a267c575fd1175171a41707a2ac80c03-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e60bdd5f7d1090f66c283ab2ebd04906-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e60bdd5f7d1090f66c283ab2ebd04906-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b35a43e83892d75bc8e3746466c2bcfc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8047b6c93b09b89977542720f829a1da-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28e61b57c4ef53155963a0bdc0146d46-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28e61b57c4ef53155963a0bdc0146d46-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-495dc2d2fa3a0bb201cd26ebaa77ad10-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-495dc2d2fa3a0bb201cd26ebaa77ad10-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6ee3143291e5ed56b99323040f30f7d7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6ee3143291e5ed56b99323040f30f7d7-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a539186415b267cf2fe68e024581d476-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a539186415b267cf2fe68e024581d476-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7eff443bdc3f8249787b9d9ee690d679-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7eff443bdc3f8249787b9d9ee690d679-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a18d9206e0b44dc082a257441a96e79d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a18d9206e0b44dc082a257441a96e79d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d9672c1c086c805dbb8f8962ec642b7a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e758367fdb2b5f6f0ba25e5351f06fae-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e758367fdb2b5f6f0ba25e5351f06fae-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-da041acb6b82f70d6eea7e644d1ab933-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-da041acb6b82f70d6eea7e644d1ab933-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-219fb4a2de2e4f86f2a836460b2e4201-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-219fb4a2de2e4f86f2a836460b2e4201-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c76c270a0e4b9c50447afdcbfd22aa1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c76c270a0e4b9c50447afdcbfd22aa1-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9756198566adacc24b429de0c91a0beb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a8496df2ccf7a2fedc35b83bd6c5e51-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a8496df2ccf7a2fedc35b83bd6c5e51-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4cbd3a65e3bbf220a047cbb226753147-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4cbd3a65e3bbf220a047cbb226753147-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-198b423c5fcf5fd72465af48d35436e5-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">barbhack-2025-ctf-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-airtouch-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-barrier-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-cctv-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-conversor-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-darkzero-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-devarea-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-eighteen-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-gavel-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-giveback-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-guardian-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-imagery-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-interpreter-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-jobtwo-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-previous-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-pterodactyl-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-signed-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-sorcery-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-soulmate-methodology.md</data>
