<node id="JWT Authentication Flow">
  <data key="d0">JWT Authentication Flow</data>
  <data key="d1">PreconditionEnvironment</data>
  <data key="d2">JWT Authentication Flow is a stateless system mechanism that employs JSON Web Tokens (JWTs) for user session management and authentication. Tokens are cryptographically signed and issued upon successful authentication to establish user identity and define access privileges. These tokens are subsequently used in subsequent requests to validate the user without the need for a session database lookup, thus streamlining authentication while offering scalability in distributed environments. The flow encompasses the entire token lifecycle, including signature verification and claims inspection, to ensure token validity, enforce session lifetimes, and determine access scopes. Security considerations are critical, as the tokens themselves become a primary attack vector for threats like token manipulation, signature bypass, or replay attacks. The implementation may occur server-side or client-side, with proper validation and scope enforcement serving as essential controls. Overall, JWT Authentication Flow relies on token-based trust rather than server-side session state, necessitating rigorous protection of token secrecy and effective key management to maintain system security.&lt;SEP&gt;An active JSON Web Token exchange mechanism present in the target application&lt;SEP&gt;A target authentication mechanism using JSON Web Tokens across endpoints.&lt;SEP&gt;A system or API endpoint that uses JSON Web Token for authentication.&lt;SEP&gt;The server-side workflow for validating and processing bearer tokens to authorize requests.&lt;SEP&gt;An authentication mechanism using JSON web tokens issued after login to maintain session state without further credentials.&lt;SEP&gt;The overall flow of signing, transmitting, and verifying JSON Web Tokens in the target application's session handling.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5b62addae42b2d3e684b41ed40260e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d193154c13a7545340d6aac7f93551ff-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d193154c13a7545340d6aac7f93551ff-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-db51747d6e1553794dcbbc6d673eb1a6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-db51747d6e1553794dcbbc6d673eb1a6-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d57f4dccb7b1de7c796c24d456b2c90f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d8a71a5db941f76cbd976ed319daa4ce-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ccb6aa44b59c087ddbe71de229597bd4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ccb6aa44b59c087ddbe71de229597bd4-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ccb6aa44b59c087ddbe71de229597bd4-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e60bdd5f7d1090f66c283ab2ebd04906-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b35a43e83892d75bc8e3746466c2bcfc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8047b6c93b09b89977542720f829a1da-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28e61b57c4ef53155963a0bdc0146d46-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6b1a9df875b4f4d10c856b106f068993-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-495dc2d2fa3a0bb201cd26ebaa77ad10-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-495dc2d2fa3a0bb201cd26ebaa77ad10-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7eff443bdc3f8249787b9d9ee690d679-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7eff443bdc3f8249787b9d9ee690d679-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a18d9206e0b44dc082a257441a96e79d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a18d9206e0b44dc082a257441a96e79d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d9672c1c086c805dbb8f8962ec642b7a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-da041acb6b82f70d6eea7e644d1ab933-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-da041acb6b82f70d6eea7e644d1ab933-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-219fb4a2de2e4f86f2a836460b2e4201-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-219fb4a2de2e4f86f2a836460b2e4201-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c76c270a0e4b9c50447afdcbfd22aa1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c76c270a0e4b9c50447afdcbfd22aa1-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c76c270a0e4b9c50447afdcbfd22aa1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a8496df2ccf7a2fedc35b83bd6c5e51-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a8496df2ccf7a2fedc35b83bd6c5e51-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4cbd3a65e3bbf220a047cbb226753147-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-198b423c5fcf5fd72465af48d35436e5-chunk-000</data>
