<node id="Command Execution">
  <data key="d0">Command Execution</data>
  <data key="d1">AttackerCapability</data>
  <data key="d2">Enables running system or database commands when the forged token permits administrative functions.&lt;SEP&gt;Command Execution is an attacker capability enabling the execution of arbitrary system commands on a target host or environment. This ability allows adversaries to run commands through shell or service interfaces, often after exploiting administrative privileges. By executing any desired command and viewing its output, attackers gain deeper control over the system. It serves as a critical building block for establishing persistence, exfiltrating data, or compromising further network resources, making it a primary objective in many cyberattacks. Generally, it involves actively running system commands via shells or web interfaces to explore, manipulate, or fully control the victim host through the operator’s discretionary input into the target system’s command processing framework.&lt;SEP&gt;An attacker ability to run arbitrary system commands on the target host with modified or elevated privileges.&lt;SEP&gt;A strategic result allowing an attacker to run arbitrary commands on the target system with the context of the web server.&lt;SEP&gt;An ability to run arbitrary system commands on the target host.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1e4ab66012df8871bd0b67c09233a063-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5b3691250d8034efc538f45153325e82-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d9672c1c086c805dbb8f8962ec642b7a-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dd80fa5ebb19e9944238770f478851fb-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28e61b57c4ef53155963a0bdc0146d46-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2af45459b5392b7945360d1fe34d952c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-db51747d6e1553794dcbbc6d673eb1a6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1e4ab66012df8871bd0b67c09233a063-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7eff443bdc3f8249787b9d9ee690d679-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-219fb4a2de2e4f86f2a836460b2e4201-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5b62addae42b2d3e684b41ed40260e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d8a71a5db941f76cbd976ed319daa4ce-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff53209713af43febf0054a8036e08a1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6ee3143291e5ed56b99323040f30f7d7-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d57f4dccb7b1de7c796c24d456b2c90f-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8047b6c93b09b89977542720f829a1da-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c76c270a0e4b9c50447afdcbfd22aa1-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4cbd3a65e3bbf220a047cbb226753147-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-198b423c5fcf5fd72465af48d35436e5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7eff443bdc3f8249787b9d9ee690d679-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-abae2141b512784d1f09780ffa398a5d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a8496df2ccf7a2fedc35b83bd6c5e51-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f25479dd4ca15c3238c1385baf2d1e75-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9d1d825cd69dea8aed6d1651fb993c0c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-219fb4a2de2e4f86f2a836460b2e4201-chunk-002</data>
