<node id="Credentials">
  <data key="d0">Credentials</data>
  <data key="d1">AttackerCapability</data>
  <data key="d2">Credentials are reusable authentication secrets such as usernames, passwords, API keys, session tokens, or similarly valid authentication data that grant or assert access to systems or data. Functionally, credentials serve as the foundational artifacts enabling unauthorized access by authenticating as legitimate users or services. These secrets can exist in plaintext, hashed form, or other usable states and are frequently sought after during reconnaissance or exploitation phases. Credentials include usernames paired with their associated passwords or hashes, API keys, session identifiers, cookies, tokens, or other login information. Once acquired through theft, harvesting, extraction from configuration files, or password cracking, these details provide attackers with the means to escalate privileges and pivot within a compromised network. Organizations face significant risk when credentials are stolen or exposed, as they become critical inputs for subsequent attack steps including account impersonation and follow-up malicious actions.&lt;SEP&gt;Stolen usernames, passwords, API keys, or session tokens collected during the attack for reuse or post-exploitation access.&lt;SEP&gt;A set of authentication tokens, keys, or secrets extracted from the target system and reusable later in the attack.&lt;SEP&gt;Stolen or cracked usernames and hashed or plaintext passwords obtained via attacks.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5b62addae42b2d3e684b41ed40260e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5b62addae42b2d3e684b41ed40260e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dd80fa5ebb19e9944238770f478851fb-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9d1d825cd69dea8aed6d1651fb993c0c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d193154c13a7545340d6aac7f93551ff-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-db51747d6e1553794dcbbc6d673eb1a6-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-db51747d6e1553794dcbbc6d673eb1a6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d57f4dccb7b1de7c796c24d456b2c90f-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-39047a18b515fcf5a6bcfa50dda4ee3a-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d8a71a5db941f76cbd976ed319daa4ce-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5b3691250d8034efc538f45153325e82-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5b3691250d8034efc538f45153325e82-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ccb6aa44b59c087ddbe71de229597bd4-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ccb6aa44b59c087ddbe71de229597bd4-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce55c93390355c438aad3e42f2558ea0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66bd77b51f9ea38a4762d65732ac21c9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66bd77b51f9ea38a4762d65732ac21c9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e60bdd5f7d1090f66c283ab2ebd04906-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8047b6c93b09b89977542720f829a1da-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8047b6c93b09b89977542720f829a1da-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28e61b57c4ef53155963a0bdc0146d46-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28e61b57c4ef53155963a0bdc0146d46-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6b1a9df875b4f4d10c856b106f068993-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6ee3143291e5ed56b99323040f30f7d7-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1e4ab66012df8871bd0b67c09233a063-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a539186415b267cf2fe68e024581d476-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e3971755d02df1ca9d73a71e46dde1d7-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7eff443bdc3f8249787b9d9ee690d679-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7eff443bdc3f8249787b9d9ee690d679-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a18d9206e0b44dc082a257441a96e79d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d9672c1c086c805dbb8f8962ec642b7a-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff53209713af43febf0054a8036e08a1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e758367fdb2b5f6f0ba25e5351f06fae-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e758367fdb2b5f6f0ba25e5351f06fae-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-da041acb6b82f70d6eea7e644d1ab933-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-da041acb6b82f70d6eea7e644d1ab933-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c76c270a0e4b9c50447afdcbfd22aa1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c76c270a0e4b9c50447afdcbfd22aa1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2af45459b5392b7945360d1fe34d952c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9756198566adacc24b429de0c91a0beb-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a8496df2ccf7a2fedc35b83bd6c5e51-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a8496df2ccf7a2fedc35b83bd6c5e51-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4cbd3a65e3bbf220a047cbb226753147-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-198b423c5fcf5fd72465af48d35436e5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f25479dd4ca15c3238c1385baf2d1e75-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">barbhack-2025-ctf-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-airtouch-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-bamboo-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-barrier-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-breach-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-browsed-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-codetwo-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-conversor-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-darkzero-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-devarea-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-eighteen-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-giveback-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-guardian-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-hacknet-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-interpreter-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-job-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-monitorsfour-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-nanocorp-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-orion-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-overwatch-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-previous-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-principal-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-signed-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-slonik-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-snapped-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-sorcery-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-soulmate-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-variatype-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-wingdata-methodology.md</data>
