<node id="Password Hash">
  <data key="d0">Password Hash</data>
  <data key="d1">Artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A concrete file artifact containing cryptographic hashes of user passwords.&lt;SEP&gt;Captured or extracted password hashes extracted from a system, database or captured tokens that can be analyzed or cracked.&lt;SEP&gt;Password Hash is a cryptographic digest of user passwords used primarily for authentication verification, serving as a securely hashed form of a user's password stored within a system. It ensures that plaintext credentials remain hidden in storage or transmission, allowing systems to verify user identity without exposing the original password. Functioning as a cryptographic summary, it enables secure authentication while introducing potential security risks if the hashing algorithm is weak or if the hashes are extracted by attackers. Password hashes represent system artifacts found in databases, files, or system memory, and serve as targets for offline attacks involving brute force, dictionary, or rainbow table attempts to crack or recover the original plaintext passwords. These hashed values are often obtained from configuration files, databases, or credential dump data, making them valuable targets in security breaches. Consequently, Password Hashes play a fundamental role in authentication practices that must be paired with strong cryptographic methods to mitigate exposure and prevent unauthorized credential recovery.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ccb6aa44b59c087ddbe71de229597bd4-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8047b6c93b09b89977542720f829a1da-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d193154c13a7545340d6aac7f93551ff-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5b3691250d8034efc538f45153325e82-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dd80fa5ebb19e9944238770f478851fb-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ccb6aa44b59c087ddbe71de229597bd4-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28e61b57c4ef53155963a0bdc0146d46-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-db51747d6e1553794dcbbc6d673eb1a6-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-39047a18b515fcf5a6bcfa50dda4ee3a-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a18d9206e0b44dc082a257441a96e79d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2af45459b5392b7945360d1fe34d952c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-db51747d6e1553794dcbbc6d673eb1a6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-495dc2d2fa3a0bb201cd26ebaa77ad10-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66bd77b51f9ea38a4762d65732ac21c9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e3971755d02df1ca9d73a71e46dde1d7-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7eff443bdc3f8249787b9d9ee690d679-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c76c270a0e4b9c50447afdcbfd22aa1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c76c270a0e4b9c50447afdcbfd22aa1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-219fb4a2de2e4f86f2a836460b2e4201-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5b62addae42b2d3e684b41ed40260e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d8a71a5db941f76cbd976ed319daa4ce-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff53209713af43febf0054a8036e08a1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6ee3143291e5ed56b99323040f30f7d7-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9756198566adacc24b429de0c91a0beb-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a8496df2ccf7a2fedc35b83bd6c5e51-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d57f4dccb7b1de7c796c24d456b2c90f-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8047b6c93b09b89977542720f829a1da-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6b1a9df875b4f4d10c856b106f068993-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c76c270a0e4b9c50447afdcbfd22aa1-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4cbd3a65e3bbf220a047cbb226753147-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66bd77b51f9ea38a4762d65732ac21c9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6ee3143291e5ed56b99323040f30f7d7-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a267c575fd1175171a41707a2ac80c03-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f25479dd4ca15c3238c1385baf2d1e75-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-219fb4a2de2e4f86f2a836460b2e4201-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9d1d825cd69dea8aed6d1651fb993c0c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-219fb4a2de2e4f86f2a836460b2e4201-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">htb-codetwo-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-conversor-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-snapped-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-slonik-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-eighteen-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-imagery-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-darkzero-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-sorcery-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-pterodactyl-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-wingdata-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-giveback-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-expressway-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-hacknet-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-airtouch-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-barrier-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;barbhack-2025-ctf-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-monitorsfour-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-browsed-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-signed-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-guardian-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-interpreter-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-soulmate-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-breach-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-overwatch-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-bamboo-methodology.md</data>
