<node id="Callback Received">
  <data key="d0">Callback Received</data>
  <data key="d1">ObservableSignal</data>
  <data key="d2">Callback Received refers to a signal or network event indicating that a callback mechanism has been successfully triggered and executed. It typically manifests as traffic flowing from a target system back to an attacker-controlled listener or URL in response to delivered payloads, such as malware or web shells. This event serves as critical evidence that previous input or commands submitted by an attacker have produced a desired action on the target server. In summary, it denotes an inbound server-side callback or beacon that confirms successful outbound interaction initiated by the attacker, often carrying useful data like authentication state or server responses to the listener.&lt;SEP&gt;Evidence indicating that an outbound request generated by an injection technique has successfully completed and returned control.&lt;SEP&gt;Indication that an expected callback has been successfully received and returned indicating local service discovery or outbound communication succeeded beyond perimeter controls.&lt;SEP&gt;A returned response or traffic indicating that an attacker-controlled server accepted a callback from the target system.&lt;SEP&gt;An externally accessible notification triggered by malformed input.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5b62addae42b2d3e684b41ed40260e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0a5b62addae42b2d3e684b41ed40260e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-abae2141b512784d1f09780ffa398a5d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9d1d825cd69dea8aed6d1651fb993c0c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-db51747d6e1553794dcbbc6d673eb1a6-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-db51747d6e1553794dcbbc6d673eb1a6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5b3691250d8034efc538f45153325e82-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ccb6aa44b59c087ddbe71de229597bd4-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6ee3143291e5ed56b99323040f30f7d7-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff53209713af43febf0054a8036e08a1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c76c270a0e4b9c50447afdcbfd22aa1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4cbd3a65e3bbf220a047cbb226753147-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f25479dd4ca15c3238c1385baf2d1e75-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">barbhack-2025-ctf-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-abducted-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-bamboo-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-breach-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-conversor-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-interpreter-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-overwatch-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-signed-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-soulmate-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-wingdata-methodology.md</data>
