<node id="Extension Blacklist">
  <data key="d0">Extension Blacklist</data>
  <data key="d1">DefensiveControl</data>
  <data key="d2">Extension Blacklist is a security mechanism implemented to restrict or deny access to files based on their extensions. It functions as a foundational control in server environments that prevents the upload, processing, or execution of file types whose extensions are associated with malicious payloads, scripts, or risky artifacts. This measure operates by matching file extensions against a predefined list of prohibited types—for example, extensions commonly linked to scripting or executable files such as .sh, .php, .asp, .jsp, .exe, or .dll. By blocking requests or uploads that include these forbidden extensions, the system limits the potential for malware distribution and execution, effectively countering common attack vectors that rely on specific file formats to deliver or leverage harmful code. In essence, the blacklist serves as a filtering mechanism that rejects dangerous file or URL extensions at the server or proxy level, disallows execution or delivery of sensitive or executable files based on extension patterns, and enforces policies to prevent unauthorized actions such as web shell delivery or the disclosure of risky uploads through restriction of browser file or script extensions.&lt;SEP&gt;A list of prohibited file extensions that are forbidden from being uploaded or executed in a target environment.&lt;SEP&gt;A server filter that blocks specific client-side file extensions to prevent malicious uploads.&lt;SEP&gt;A list of blocked file extensions or software components to mitigate common attack vectors.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5b62addae42b2d3e684b41ed40260e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dd80fa5ebb19e9944238770f478851fb-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dd80fa5ebb19e9944238770f478851fb-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d193154c13a7545340d6aac7f93551ff-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-db51747d6e1553794dcbbc6d673eb1a6-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d57f4dccb7b1de7c796c24d456b2c90f-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d8a71a5db941f76cbd976ed319daa4ce-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5b3691250d8034efc538f45153325e82-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ccb6aa44b59c087ddbe71de229597bd4-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ccb6aa44b59c087ddbe71de229597bd4-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce55c93390355c438aad3e42f2558ea0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce55c93390355c438aad3e42f2558ea0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-495dc2d2fa3a0bb201cd26ebaa77ad10-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a539186415b267cf2fe68e024581d476-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a539186415b267cf2fe68e024581d476-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a18d9206e0b44dc082a257441a96e79d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d9672c1c086c805dbb8f8962ec642b7a-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-219fb4a2de2e4f86f2a836460b2e4201-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c76c270a0e4b9c50447afdcbfd22aa1-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a8496df2ccf7a2fedc35b83bd6c5e51-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a8496df2ccf7a2fedc35b83bd6c5e51-chunk-002</data>
