<node id="Execute Code">
  <data key="d0">Execute Code</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0a5b62addae42b2d3e684b41ed40260e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9d1d825cd69dea8aed6d1651fb993c0c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-db51747d6e1553794dcbbc6d673eb1a6-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-db51747d6e1553794dcbbc6d673eb1a6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d57f4dccb7b1de7c796c24d456b2c90f-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-136da9e7ebc65a69c7a4923c2daacd7b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-39047a18b515fcf5a6bcfa50dda4ee3a-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d8a71a5db941f76cbd976ed319daa4ce-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5b3691250d8034efc538f45153325e82-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ccb6aa44b59c087ddbe71de229597bd4-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8047b6c93b09b89977542720f829a1da-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28e61b57c4ef53155963a0bdc0146d46-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e3971755d02df1ca9d73a71e46dde1d7-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-219fb4a2de2e4f86f2a836460b2e4201-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c76c270a0e4b9c50447afdcbfd22aa1-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a8496df2ccf7a2fedc35b83bd6c5e51-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-198b423c5fcf5fd72465af48d35436e5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f25479dd4ca15c3238c1385baf2d1e75-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d2">Execute Code refers to the strategic objective of an attacker to run arbitrary malicious commands or scripts within the context of the target system or server environment. This objective is central to achieving persistence on the target infrastructure, facilitating data exfiltration, or advancing a compromise to escalate privileges by gaining control over the server. By executing unauthorized code, the attacker effectively runs attacker-supplied instructions within the target environment, allowing the execution of unintended programs or scripts to conduct further malicious activities.&lt;SEP&gt;The strategic intent to run arbitrary code within the target environment.&lt;SEP&gt;Strategic objective to run malicious scripts, binaries, or queries on the target machine or backend.&lt;SEP&gt;An objective to run arbitrary commands or scripts directly on the target system to gain control or access resources.&lt;SEP&gt;An objective to run arbitrary code on the target system to achieve broader compromise or unauthorized actions.&lt;SEP&gt;Strategic objective to run arbitrary malicious code on the target server.</data>
  <data key="d1">AttackGoal</data>
