<node id="Internal Service Reachability">
  <data key="d0">Internal Service Reachability</data>
  <data key="d1">AttackerCapability</data>
  <data key="d2">Enables discovery or interaction with internal-only services accessible via the SSRF vulnerability in the application.&lt;SEP&gt;Internal Service Reachability is the capability for an attacker to connect to, interact with, or probe backend, internal-only, or restricted network services and endpoints that are not intended for external exposure, bypassing network access controls, firewalls, and security boundaries. This condition allows the attacker to leverage their current position — often external or compromised — to access services restricted to the local or internal network, thereby circumventing perimeter defenses. Common techniques for achieving this include Server-Side Request Forgery (SSRF), among others. This represents a significant security concern, as establishing such reachability often enables further exploitation, including discovery of internal systems, access to sensitive data, or abuse of other misconfigurations within the internal network infrastructure.&lt;SEP&gt;A condition where internal network services, such as those only reachable via localhost, are exposed to external access through the target.&lt;SEP&gt;Control or knowledge of services bound only to localhost or internal networks.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ccb6aa44b59c087ddbe71de229597bd4-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1e4ab66012df8871bd0b67c09233a063-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d9672c1c086c805dbb8f8962ec642b7a-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ccb6aa44b59c087ddbe71de229597bd4-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-da041acb6b82f70d6eea7e644d1ab933-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a8496df2ccf7a2fedc35b83bd6c5e51-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2af45459b5392b7945360d1fe34d952c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1e4ab66012df8871bd0b67c09233a063-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7eff443bdc3f8249787b9d9ee690d679-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dd80fa5ebb19e9944238770f478851fb-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce55c93390355c438aad3e42f2558ea0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c76c270a0e4b9c50447afdcbfd22aa1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a539186415b267cf2fe68e024581d476-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-219fb4a2de2e4f86f2a836460b2e4201-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6ee3143291e5ed56b99323040f30f7d7-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d57f4dccb7b1de7c796c24d456b2c90f-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4cbd3a65e3bbf220a047cbb226753147-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8047b6c93b09b89977542720f829a1da-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c76c270a0e4b9c50447afdcbfd22aa1-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4cbd3a65e3bbf220a047cbb226753147-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-abae2141b512784d1f09780ffa398a5d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f25479dd4ca15c3238c1385baf2d1e75-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9d1d825cd69dea8aed6d1651fb993c0c-chunk-000</data>
