<node id="SQL Comment Auth Bypass Payload">
  <data key="d0">SQL Comment Auth Bypass Payload</data>
  <data key="d1">PayloadPattern</data>
  <data key="d2">Employed specifically for bypassing application-level authentication validation within SQL injection payloads.&lt;SEP&gt;SQL Comment Auth Bypass Payload refers to a parameterized input string designed to exploit vulnerabilities in database systems by strategically leveraging SQL comment syntax to evade authentication mechanisms. Its core characteristic involves the use of comment sequences such as ``--`` for inline comments or ``/*`` and ``*/`` for block comments to obscure subsequent malicious code and bypass conditional logic during SQL query parsing. Categorized under SQL Injection attacks, these payloads are primarily aimed at skipping or subverting login procedures, access control checks, and permission-based restrictions to enable unauthorized data extraction or command execution. They often employ encoding or are combined with other evasion techniques to circumvent security signatures and detection by systems such as Web Application Firewalls (WAFs). Functionally, the payload follows a parameterized structure where comment syntax is embedded within user-supplied input to mask malicious query portions, allowing attackers to enumerate users, bypass application-level authentication checks within SQL queries, and perform unauthorized operations despite existing security defenses.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ccb6aa44b59c087ddbe71de229597bd4-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8047b6c93b09b89977542720f829a1da-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1e4ab66012df8871bd0b67c09233a063-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d9672c1c086c805dbb8f8962ec642b7a-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d193154c13a7545340d6aac7f93551ff-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a18d9206e0b44dc082a257441a96e79d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dd80fa5ebb19e9944238770f478851fb-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28e61b57c4ef53155963a0bdc0146d46-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ccb6aa44b59c087ddbe71de229597bd4-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-db51747d6e1553794dcbbc6d673eb1a6-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-39047a18b515fcf5a6bcfa50dda4ee3a-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a18d9206e0b44dc082a257441a96e79d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a8496df2ccf7a2fedc35b83bd6c5e51-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2af45459b5392b7945360d1fe34d952c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a539186415b267cf2fe68e024581d476-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1e4ab66012df8871bd0b67c09233a063-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7eff443bdc3f8249787b9d9ee690d679-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce55c93390355c438aad3e42f2558ea0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9d1d825cd69dea8aed6d1651fb993c0c-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c76c270a0e4b9c50447afdcbfd22aa1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a539186415b267cf2fe68e024581d476-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-219fb4a2de2e4f86f2a836460b2e4201-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d8a71a5db941f76cbd976ed319daa4ce-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d57f4dccb7b1de7c796c24d456b2c90f-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6b1a9df875b4f4d10c856b106f068993-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66bd77b51f9ea38a4762d65732ac21c9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-abae2141b512784d1f09780ffa398a5d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a8496df2ccf7a2fedc35b83bd6c5e51-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-da041acb6b82f70d6eea7e644d1ab933-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9d1d825cd69dea8aed6d1651fb993c0c-chunk-000</data>
