<node id="SSRF Localhost Probing">
  <data key="d0">SSRF Localhost Probing</data>
  <data key="d1">AttackTechnique</data>
  <data key="d2">SSRF Localhost Probing is a security technique that exploits Server-Side Request Forgery (SSRF) vulnerabilities to probe and interact with internal network resources accessible via loopback addresses, such as 127.0.0.1 or ::1. Attackers achieve this by inserting specially crafted URLs into user-controllable input fields that manipulate the server into fetching or connecting to these local interfaces. Typically, this bypasses network restrictions designed to isolate internal systems from external access, effectively converting an application into an unintended tool for reconnaissance of otherwise hidden infrastructure. The primary objective is to elicit responses from local services, enumerate internal components, extract sensitive information, or uncover misconfigurations that may facilitate privilege escalation. By leveraging the server's outbound request capabilities to target localhost or internal network assets, malicious actors can tunnel requests through a trusted network to probe services that should remain inaccessible from outside the network. In summary, this technique uses crafted user input to coerce a server into establishing connections to local-only resources, revealing details about the internal environment that were not intended for external disclosure.&lt;SEP&gt;An action that probes localhost services via external interfaces to discover internal network exposure.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-dd80fa5ebb19e9944238770f478851fb-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dd80fa5ebb19e9944238770f478851fb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9d1d825cd69dea8aed6d1651fb993c0c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9d1d825cd69dea8aed6d1651fb993c0c-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d193154c13a7545340d6aac7f93551ff-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d193154c13a7545340d6aac7f93551ff-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d57f4dccb7b1de7c796c24d456b2c90f-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d57f4dccb7b1de7c796c24d456b2c90f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-39047a18b515fcf5a6bcfa50dda4ee3a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-39047a18b515fcf5a6bcfa50dda4ee3a-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ccb6aa44b59c087ddbe71de229597bd4-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66bd77b51f9ea38a4762d65732ac21c9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e60bdd5f7d1090f66c283ab2ebd04906-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e60bdd5f7d1090f66c283ab2ebd04906-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b35a43e83892d75bc8e3746466c2bcfc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8047b6c93b09b89977542720f829a1da-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8047b6c93b09b89977542720f829a1da-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28e61b57c4ef53155963a0bdc0146d46-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-495dc2d2fa3a0bb201cd26ebaa77ad10-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-495dc2d2fa3a0bb201cd26ebaa77ad10-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6ee3143291e5ed56b99323040f30f7d7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6ee3143291e5ed56b99323040f30f7d7-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1e4ab66012df8871bd0b67c09233a063-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1e4ab66012df8871bd0b67c09233a063-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a539186415b267cf2fe68e024581d476-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e3971755d02df1ca9d73a71e46dde1d7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7eff443bdc3f8249787b9d9ee690d679-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7eff443bdc3f8249787b9d9ee690d679-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a18d9206e0b44dc082a257441a96e79d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a18d9206e0b44dc082a257441a96e79d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d9672c1c086c805dbb8f8962ec642b7a-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d9672c1c086c805dbb8f8962ec642b7a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff53209713af43febf0054a8036e08a1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff53209713af43febf0054a8036e08a1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e758367fdb2b5f6f0ba25e5351f06fae-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-219fb4a2de2e4f86f2a836460b2e4201-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c76c270a0e4b9c50447afdcbfd22aa1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c76c270a0e4b9c50447afdcbfd22aa1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c76c270a0e4b9c50447afdcbfd22aa1-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2af45459b5392b7945360d1fe34d952c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9756198566adacc24b429de0c91a0beb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a8496df2ccf7a2fedc35b83bd6c5e51-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4cbd3a65e3bbf220a047cbb226753147-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4cbd3a65e3bbf220a047cbb226753147-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-198b423c5fcf5fd72465af48d35436e5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f25479dd4ca15c3238c1385baf2d1e75-chunk-000</data>
