<node id="PHP">
  <data key="d0">PHP</data>
  <data key="d1">TechnologyStack</data>
  <data key="d2">A web application environment based on the PHP programming language often with associated frameworks and databases.&lt;SEP&gt;PHP is a server-side scripting language widely used for web development to generate dynamic web pages and handle backend logic. It executes server-side code to produce web pages with dynamic behavior such as database interactions, session management, and user input handling. Due to its ubiquity, PHP applications and interpreters frequently become targets for web shell uploads and alternate extension bypasses. Security assessments often focus on PHP code to identify insecure features like improper file uploads, command execution vulnerabilities, and potential exploits through insecure deserialization of user-provided data. While it remains a foundational technology for many web applications, its prevalence also makes it a common vector for injection and execution flaws, necessitating robust security practices during development and deployment.&lt;SEP&gt;A server-side scripting language used in web application development and relevant to the observed attack techniques.&lt;SEP&gt;A server-side scripting language commonly used for web applications, identifiable as the target backend technology.&lt;SEP&gt;Server-side scripting language commonly used in web applications and under examination for vulnerabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;A server-side scripting language commonly associated with web applications and injections.&lt;SEP&gt;A web scripting language often used for dynamic server-side application development, targeted by various web attacks.&lt;SEP&gt;A popular server-side scripting language used for dynamic web page generation and backend logic.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-8047b6c93b09b89977542720f829a1da-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d57f4dccb7b1de7c796c24d456b2c90f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5b3691250d8034efc538f45153325e82-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-198b423c5fcf5fd72465af48d35436e5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b35a43e83892d75bc8e3746466c2bcfc-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dd80fa5ebb19e9944238770f478851fb-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dd80fa5ebb19e9944238770f478851fb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7eff443bdc3f8249787b9d9ee690d679-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a18d9206e0b44dc082a257441a96e79d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d9672c1c086c805dbb8f8962ec642b7a-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dd80fa5ebb19e9944238770f478851fb-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-219fb4a2de2e4f86f2a836460b2e4201-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4cbd3a65e3bbf220a047cbb226753147-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-219fb4a2de2e4f86f2a836460b2e4201-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d9672c1c086c805dbb8f8962ec642b7a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28e61b57c4ef53155963a0bdc0146d46-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-219fb4a2de2e4f86f2a836460b2e4201-chunk-002</data>
