<node id="Uploaded Webshell">
  <data key="d0">Uploaded Webshell</data>
  <data key="d1">Artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A concrete file artifact consisting of a malicious web shell that has been uploaded to the target server and remains within scope.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique outputs the malicious script as a saved artifact on the server.&lt;SEP&gt;Uploaded Webshell: A malicious script uploaded to the web server filesystem to facilitate remote access, command execution, or post-exploitation control. This script enables the attacker to gain persistent or stealthy access to the target web server or application backend. Typically deployed via exploitation of vulnerabilities, the uploaded webshell is invoked through HTTP requests to execute arbitrary system commands, upload additional tools, pivot within the network, or maintain access for extended periods. Its primary purpose is to provide the attacker with a backdoor mechanism to compromise the server's security and facilitate further malicious activities while remaining concealed within the server environment.&lt;SEP&gt;A malicious script file uploaded to the target environment to gain persistence and code execution.&lt;SEP&gt;A malicious script file uploaded to the target environment for remote command execution.&lt;SEP&gt;Arbitrary script (e.g., PHP, ASP) uploaded to the target for remote command execution or further exploitation.&lt;SEP&gt;An uploaded executable script placed on the target server for remote code execution or lateral movement.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-8047b6c93b09b89977542720f829a1da-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1e4ab66012df8871bd0b67c09233a063-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d193154c13a7545340d6aac7f93551ff-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5b3691250d8034efc538f45153325e82-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28e61b57c4ef53155963a0bdc0146d46-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dd80fa5ebb19e9944238770f478851fb-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a18d9206e0b44dc082a257441a96e79d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28e61b57c4ef53155963a0bdc0146d46-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d9672c1c086c805dbb8f8962ec642b7a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-39047a18b515fcf5a6bcfa50dda4ee3a-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1e4ab66012df8871bd0b67c09233a063-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7eff443bdc3f8249787b9d9ee690d679-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dd80fa5ebb19e9944238770f478851fb-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8047b6c93b09b89977542720f829a1da-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d57f4dccb7b1de7c796c24d456b2c90f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-198b423c5fcf5fd72465af48d35436e5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4cbd3a65e3bbf220a047cbb226753147-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7eff443bdc3f8249787b9d9ee690d679-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-219fb4a2de2e4f86f2a836460b2e4201-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-219fb4a2de2e4f86f2a836460b2e4201-chunk-002</data>
