<node id="Token Signing Ability">
  <data key="d0">Token Signing Ability</data>
  <data key="d1">AttackerCapability</data>
  <data key="d2">The capability to generate valid signed tokens or forge existing ones without detection.&lt;SEP&gt;Capability to create, forge, or modify tokens (such as JWTs) without access to the secret key or proper validation.&lt;SEP&gt;The capability to forge or modify valid authentication tokens that the server will accept, often leading to unauthorized access.&lt;SEP&gt;An existing attacker capability to generate, sign, or forge valid credentials or tokens required for specific APIs or services.&lt;SEP&gt;An ability to create valid tokens mimicking legitimate signing keys to bypass session or authentication checks.&lt;SEP&gt;The attacker's capability to generate, forge, or manipulate valid JWT tokens due to knowledge of the secret or algorithm</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-dd80fa5ebb19e9944238770f478851fb-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-39047a18b515fcf5a6bcfa50dda4ee3a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce55c93390355c438aad3e42f2558ea0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66bd77b51f9ea38a4762d65732ac21c9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-495dc2d2fa3a0bb201cd26ebaa77ad10-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6ee3143291e5ed56b99323040f30f7d7-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6ee3143291e5ed56b99323040f30f7d7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a539186415b267cf2fe68e024581d476-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e758367fdb2b5f6f0ba25e5351f06fae-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-da041acb6b82f70d6eea7e644d1ab933-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-da041acb6b82f70d6eea7e644d1ab933-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-219fb4a2de2e4f86f2a836460b2e4201-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a8496df2ccf7a2fedc35b83bd6c5e51-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">htb-airtouch-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-cctv-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-devarea-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-interpreter-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-jobtwo-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-principal-methodology.md</data>
