<node id="Accessible Upload Handler">
  <data key="d0">Accessible Upload Handler</data>
  <data key="d1">PreconditionEnvironment</data>
  <data key="d2">When the web application provides a directory or endpoint where files can be uploaded for resources such as user avatars or themes.&lt;SEP&gt;Accessible Upload Handler is a web endpoint or component configured to accept and process user-uploaded files or data through form interfaces or direct API calls, saving content to the server's file system for later web access. While fulfilling an essential user-facing function for content submission such as images and documents, these handlers become significant security risks when inadequately secured. Exposed configurations lacking authentication, permission checks, or input validation allow attackers — whether unauthenticated or authenticated — to interact with the handler. This vulnerability serves as a critical attack vector, frequently enabling malicious actors to upload and install webshells, execute remote code, exfiltrate data, or fully compromise the server. Consequently, an Accessible Upload Handler describes a target condition where a reachable upload endpoint accepts user-supplied data without proper validation or extension controls, permitting the unauthorized storage of malicious artifacts on the system.&lt;SEP&gt;A web endpoint or interface that allows receiving, storing, or processing uploaded files from unauthenticated or low-privilege users.&lt;SEP&gt;A web endpoint or functionality that accepts and processes user-uploaded files.&lt;SEP&gt;A target file-upload component reachable via API, web form or service, subject to insufficient validation.&lt;SEP&gt;A target component or endpoint that accepts and processes user-uploaded files without adequate validation.&lt;SEP&gt;An upload endpoint accessible to an attacker that lacks sufficient restriction on file type or size.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7eff443bdc3f8249787b9d9ee690d679-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5b3691250d8034efc538f45153325e82-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff53209713af43febf0054a8036e08a1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8047b6c93b09b89977542720f829a1da-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5b3691250d8034efc538f45153325e82-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8047b6c93b09b89977542720f829a1da-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28e61b57c4ef53155963a0bdc0146d46-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dd80fa5ebb19e9944238770f478851fb-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a18d9206e0b44dc082a257441a96e79d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-495dc2d2fa3a0bb201cd26ebaa77ad10-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-db51747d6e1553794dcbbc6d673eb1a6-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a18d9206e0b44dc082a257441a96e79d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d8a71a5db941f76cbd976ed319daa4ce-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a8496df2ccf7a2fedc35b83bd6c5e51-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2af45459b5392b7945360d1fe34d952c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-db51747d6e1553794dcbbc6d673eb1a6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dd80fa5ebb19e9944238770f478851fb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a539186415b267cf2fe68e024581d476-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66bd77b51f9ea38a4762d65732ac21c9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1e4ab66012df8871bd0b67c09233a063-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e3971755d02df1ca9d73a71e46dde1d7-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-39047a18b515fcf5a6bcfa50dda4ee3a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-136da9e7ebc65a69c7a4923c2daacd7b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c76c270a0e4b9c50447afdcbfd22aa1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9d1d825cd69dea8aed6d1651fb993c0c-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-198b423c5fcf5fd72465af48d35436e5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce55c93390355c438aad3e42f2558ea0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e60bdd5f7d1090f66c283ab2ebd04906-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c76c270a0e4b9c50447afdcbfd22aa1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a539186415b267cf2fe68e024581d476-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9756198566adacc24b429de0c91a0beb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff53209713af43febf0054a8036e08a1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9756198566adacc24b429de0c91a0beb-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2af45459b5392b7945360d1fe34d952c-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a8496df2ccf7a2fedc35b83bd6c5e51-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d57f4dccb7b1de7c796c24d456b2c90f-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d57f4dccb7b1de7c796c24d456b2c90f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c76c270a0e4b9c50447afdcbfd22aa1-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4cbd3a65e3bbf220a047cbb226753147-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-198b423c5fcf5fd72465af48d35436e5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66bd77b51f9ea38a4762d65732ac21c9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7eff443bdc3f8249787b9d9ee690d679-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a8496df2ccf7a2fedc35b83bd6c5e51-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-219fb4a2de2e4f86f2a836460b2e4201-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9d1d825cd69dea8aed6d1651fb993c0c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ccb6aa44b59c087ddbe71de229597bd4-chunk-000</data>
