<node id="Exposed Git Repository">
  <data key="d0">Exposed Git Repository</data>
  <data key="d1">PreconditionEnvironment</data>
  <data key="d2">Exposed Git Repository: An Exposed Git Repository is a publicly reachable or unauthenticated-accessible instance of a source code repository that contains sensitive or confidential information. Such repositories may expose source code along with configuration files, credentials, or authentication secrets due to improper security settings. These repositories can be found inadvertently exposed on web or network boundaries, constituting a significant security risk, often resulting from misconfigurations or accidental breaches that leave data, code, and infrastructure details publicly accessible.&lt;SEP&gt;A publicly accessible Git repository exposing source code and commit history.&lt;SEP&gt;A publicly or misconfigured repository exposing source code, configuration, or credentials.&lt;SEP&gt;A target condition where a Git repository is accessible without proper authentication.&lt;SEP&gt;A publicly exposed or weakly secured Git repository that provides source code and configuration files for extraction or review.&lt;SEP&gt;A publicly accessible Git repository that can serve as a source for configuration secrets or artifacts.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-dd80fa5ebb19e9944238770f478851fb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9d1d825cd69dea8aed6d1651fb993c0c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d57f4dccb7b1de7c796c24d456b2c90f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ccb6aa44b59c087ddbe71de229597bd4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66bd77b51f9ea38a4762d65732ac21c9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66bd77b51f9ea38a4762d65732ac21c9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b35a43e83892d75bc8e3746466c2bcfc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8047b6c93b09b89977542720f829a1da-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28e61b57c4ef53155963a0bdc0146d46-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e3971755d02df1ca9d73a71e46dde1d7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7eff443bdc3f8249787b9d9ee690d679-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d9672c1c086c805dbb8f8962ec642b7a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e758367fdb2b5f6f0ba25e5351f06fae-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a8496df2ccf7a2fedc35b83bd6c5e51-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-198b423c5fcf5fd72465af48d35436e5-chunk-002</data>
