<node id="Writable WebDAV Path">
  <data key="d0">Writable WebDAV Path</data>
  <data key="d1">PreconditionEnvironment</data>
  <data key="d2">Writable WebDAV Path refers to a WebDAV-enabled directory or resource that permits write operations, file uploads, or modifications over HTTP/HTTPS. Such a path provides write permissions, enabling the creation, alteration, or deletion of files remotely. When improperly secured, it becomes an attack vector, allowing threat actors to upload malicious files that can later be accessed to compromise the target host. It is characterized by a lack of stringent validation or access control mechanisms, making it vulnerable to unauthorized exploitation.&lt;SEP&gt;A target condition where a WebDAV directory is writable and allows arbitrary file creation by the attacker.&lt;SEP&gt;A target condition where a WebDAV endpoint accepts HTTP PUT, DELETE or other write operations that can alter server state.&lt;SEP&gt;An accessible WebDAV function that accepts create, write, or modify requests from the tester.&lt;SEP&gt;WebDAV share location accepting write operations.&lt;SEP&gt;A WebDAV interface or path configured to allow unauthenticated or authenticated file creation, modification, or deletion by users.&lt;SEP&gt;A writable WebDAV interface permitting file creation or replacement that can be exploited for arbitrary file upload.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-dd80fa5ebb19e9944238770f478851fb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9d1d825cd69dea8aed6d1651fb993c0c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-db51747d6e1553794dcbbc6d673eb1a6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d8a71a5db941f76cbd976ed319daa4ce-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5b3691250d8034efc538f45153325e82-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ccb6aa44b59c087ddbe71de229597bd4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e60bdd5f7d1090f66c283ab2ebd04906-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b35a43e83892d75bc8e3746466c2bcfc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-495dc2d2fa3a0bb201cd26ebaa77ad10-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6ee3143291e5ed56b99323040f30f7d7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a18d9206e0b44dc082a257441a96e79d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff53209713af43febf0054a8036e08a1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9756198566adacc24b429de0c91a0beb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a8496df2ccf7a2fedc35b83bd6c5e51-chunk-000</data>
