<node id="Executable Extension Interpreted">
  <data key="d0">Executable Extension Interpreted</data>
  <data key="d1">PreconditionEnvironment</data>
  <data key="d2">Executable Extension Interpreted refers to a server or service configuration in which a web server parses and executes files based on their filename extensions. When the server receives a request—typically via upload or direct access—it evaluates the file extension (such as `.php`, `.py`, `.js`, `.sh`, `.asp`, or `.exe`) and, lacking rigorous validation or secure handling of input, may treat the file as executable or interpreted code. This mechanism usually stems from a web server's default or misconfigured behavior that maps certain extensions to corresponding interpreters or scripts, thereby enabling server-side execution for incoming files that match those extensions. However, relying on extensions as a security indicator creates a critical vulnerability: attackers can exploit this oversight by submitting malicious files with matching extensions, leading to unauthorized code execution or other security breaches. Consequently, an environment flagged with Executable Extension Interpreted represents a substantial risk in web application security, often discovered during assessments, due to the potential for both deliberate malicious attacks and accidental misconfigurations to compromise the server.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-dd80fa5ebb19e9944238770f478851fb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d57f4dccb7b1de7c796c24d456b2c90f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-39047a18b515fcf5a6bcfa50dda4ee3a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-39047a18b515fcf5a6bcfa50dda4ee3a-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b35a43e83892d75bc8e3746466c2bcfc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8047b6c93b09b89977542720f829a1da-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8047b6c93b09b89977542720f829a1da-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28e61b57c4ef53155963a0bdc0146d46-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6ee3143291e5ed56b99323040f30f7d7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6ee3143291e5ed56b99323040f30f7d7-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e3971755d02df1ca9d73a71e46dde1d7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7eff443bdc3f8249787b9d9ee690d679-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7eff443bdc3f8249787b9d9ee690d679-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a18d9206e0b44dc082a257441a96e79d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-219fb4a2de2e4f86f2a836460b2e4201-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-219fb4a2de2e4f86f2a836460b2e4201-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-219fb4a2de2e4f86f2a836460b2e4201-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4cbd3a65e3bbf220a047cbb226753147-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-198b423c5fcf5fd72465af48d35436e5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-198b423c5fcf5fd72465af48d35436e5-chunk-000</data>
