<node id="Accessible API Endpoint">
  <data key="d0">Accessible API Endpoint</data>
  <data key="d1">PreconditionEnvironment</data>
  <data key="d2">Accessible API Endpoint is a network-exposed API call reachable via HTTP protocol, defined by its ability to process user-controlled parameters or payloads under conditions of insufficient authentication or authorization enforcement. This environmental state renders such endpoints reachable not only by legitimate clients but also by external systems or testers, thereby significantly expanding the potential attack surface. Without strict access control measures, these endpoints directly route user-supplied requests to backend processing logic, creating a clear vector for unauthorized access, data manipulation, or injection attacks. Consequently, they are frequently targeted in security testing and exploitation scenarios due to their discoverable nature and permissive handling of external input. Essentially, the term describes an API route's accessibility and interactability from external control, where the absence of robust security mechanisms creates vulnerabilities exploitable through probing or injection techniques to traverse internal system boundaries and compromise backend resources.&lt;SEP&gt;A target API interface that can be called with user-controlled input.&lt;SEP&gt;An API operation or endpoint that accepts requests and returns data based on user-controlled parameters.&lt;SEP&gt;A target API endpoint that accepts requests and is within the attack scope.&lt;SEP&gt;An exploitable API endpoint reachable by the attacker, often lacking sufficient input validation or authorization.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-dd80fa5ebb19e9944238770f478851fb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9d1d825cd69dea8aed6d1651fb993c0c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d193154c13a7545340d6aac7f93551ff-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-db51747d6e1553794dcbbc6d673eb1a6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d57f4dccb7b1de7c796c24d456b2c90f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d57f4dccb7b1de7c796c24d456b2c90f-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-136da9e7ebc65a69c7a4923c2daacd7b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-39047a18b515fcf5a6bcfa50dda4ee3a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-39047a18b515fcf5a6bcfa50dda4ee3a-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d8a71a5db941f76cbd976ed319daa4ce-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5b3691250d8034efc538f45153325e82-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ccb6aa44b59c087ddbe71de229597bd4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce55c93390355c438aad3e42f2558ea0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e60bdd5f7d1090f66c283ab2ebd04906-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b35a43e83892d75bc8e3746466c2bcfc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8047b6c93b09b89977542720f829a1da-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8047b6c93b09b89977542720f829a1da-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28e61b57c4ef53155963a0bdc0146d46-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-495dc2d2fa3a0bb201cd26ebaa77ad10-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-495dc2d2fa3a0bb201cd26ebaa77ad10-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6ee3143291e5ed56b99323040f30f7d7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6ee3143291e5ed56b99323040f30f7d7-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e3971755d02df1ca9d73a71e46dde1d7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7eff443bdc3f8249787b9d9ee690d679-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7eff443bdc3f8249787b9d9ee690d679-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a18d9206e0b44dc082a257441a96e79d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a18d9206e0b44dc082a257441a96e79d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff53209713af43febf0054a8036e08a1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff53209713af43febf0054a8036e08a1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e758367fdb2b5f6f0ba25e5351f06fae-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e758367fdb2b5f6f0ba25e5351f06fae-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-da041acb6b82f70d6eea7e644d1ab933-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-219fb4a2de2e4f86f2a836460b2e4201-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-219fb4a2de2e4f86f2a836460b2e4201-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9756198566adacc24b429de0c91a0beb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a8496df2ccf7a2fedc35b83bd6c5e51-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a8496df2ccf7a2fedc35b83bd6c5e51-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a8496df2ccf7a2fedc35b83bd6c5e51-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-198b423c5fcf5fd72465af48d35436e5-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">htb-airtouch-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-bamboo-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-breach-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-browsed-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-bruno-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-cctv-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-codetwo-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-conversor-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-darkzero-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-facts-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-gavel-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-giveback-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-imagery-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-interpreter-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-monitorsfour-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-nanocorp-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-overwatch-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-previous-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-pterodactyl-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-snapped-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-sorcery-methodology.md</data>
