<node id="User-Controlled Input Reaches Query">
  <data key="d0">User-Controlled Input Reaches Query</data>
  <data key="d1">PreconditionEnvironment</data>
  <data key="d2">User-Controlled Input Reaches Query refers to a critical security condition in which unvalidated or unsanitized user-provided data is directly inserted into backend queries, API parameters, or system commands without adequate safeguards. This uncontrolled flow creates significant security vulnerabilities, exposing applications to injection attacks such as SQL injection and command injection by allowing malicious or unintended input to alter the logic or behavior of database queries, web services, or internal system processes. The security flaw occurs whenever user input is blindly passed from the front end through business logic into query construction or execution, bypassing essential input validation or neutralization steps. This condition affects various components including database queries, API calls, stored procedures, and shell commands, potentially leading to unauthorized access, data breaches, or complete system compromise. In essence, it represents a fundamental weakness in application security architecture where user-supplied data is directly passed into backend query generation without proper sanitization.&lt;SEP&gt;User-provided input is inserted into backend queries without adequate sanitization or validation.&lt;SEP&gt;A condition where attacker-controlled input is processed by server-side code before evaluating database or LDAP statements.&lt;SEP&gt;An environmental condition where user input passes to backend query handling without sanitization.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e60bdd5f7d1090f66c283ab2ebd04906-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dd80fa5ebb19e9944238770f478851fb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-db51747d6e1553794dcbbc6d673eb1a6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d57f4dccb7b1de7c796c24d456b2c90f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d57f4dccb7b1de7c796c24d456b2c90f-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-39047a18b515fcf5a6bcfa50dda4ee3a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-39047a18b515fcf5a6bcfa50dda4ee3a-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d8a71a5db941f76cbd976ed319daa4ce-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5b3691250d8034efc538f45153325e82-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ccb6aa44b59c087ddbe71de229597bd4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce55c93390355c438aad3e42f2558ea0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce55c93390355c438aad3e42f2558ea0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66bd77b51f9ea38a4762d65732ac21c9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e60bdd5f7d1090f66c283ab2ebd04906-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b35a43e83892d75bc8e3746466c2bcfc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8047b6c93b09b89977542720f829a1da-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8047b6c93b09b89977542720f829a1da-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8047b6c93b09b89977542720f829a1da-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28e61b57c4ef53155963a0bdc0146d46-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6b1a9df875b4f4d10c856b106f068993-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-495dc2d2fa3a0bb201cd26ebaa77ad10-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-495dc2d2fa3a0bb201cd26ebaa77ad10-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6ee3143291e5ed56b99323040f30f7d7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a539186415b267cf2fe68e024581d476-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e3971755d02df1ca9d73a71e46dde1d7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7eff443bdc3f8249787b9d9ee690d679-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a18d9206e0b44dc082a257441a96e79d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d9672c1c086c805dbb8f8962ec642b7a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff53209713af43febf0054a8036e08a1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-da041acb6b82f70d6eea7e644d1ab933-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-da041acb6b82f70d6eea7e644d1ab933-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-219fb4a2de2e4f86f2a836460b2e4201-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-219fb4a2de2e4f86f2a836460b2e4201-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-219fb4a2de2e4f86f2a836460b2e4201-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2af45459b5392b7945360d1fe34d952c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9756198566adacc24b429de0c91a0beb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a8496df2ccf7a2fedc35b83bd6c5e51-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a8496df2ccf7a2fedc35b83bd6c5e51-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4cbd3a65e3bbf220a047cbb226753147-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-198b423c5fcf5fd72465af48d35436e5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f25479dd4ca15c3238c1385baf2d1e75-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">htb-codetwo-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-conversor-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-eighteen-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-cctv-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-darkzero-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-imagery-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-nanocorp-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-giveback-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-hacknet-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-jobtwo-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-logging-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-devarea-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-airtouch-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-gavel-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-monitorsfour-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-facts-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-browsed-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-guardian-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-interpreter-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-breach-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-overwatch-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-principal-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-pterodactyl-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-slonik-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-snapped-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-sorcery-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-wingdata-methodology.md</data>
