</node>
<node id="Source Code Review">
  <data key="d0">Source Code Review</data>
  <data key="d1">AttackTechnique</data>
  <data key="d2">Source Code Review is a systematic technique for analyzing source code—typically from public repositories, exposed APIs, or extracted builds—to identify security vulnerabilities, sensitive information disclosures, and configuration weaknesses. It involves methodical scrutiny of code files to detect hard-coded credentials, misconfigurations, improper trust boundaries, injection points, and insecure implementation flaws. This process allows organizations to uncover logic weaknesses, hidden capabilities, and exploitable components before they can be leveraged by attackers. By extracting configuration data, secrets, and identifying potential attack vectors such as privilege escalation or sensitive data leaks, source code review informs risk mitigation strategies and strengthens the overall security posture of software systems. It is employed both defensively by security teams to remediate issues proactively and offensively by threat actors to map potential exploitation paths, making it a critical component in application security testing and software development lifecycle security practices.&lt;SEP&gt;A testing activity analyzing accessible source code repositories to discover hardcoded credentials, logic flaws, or path traversal opportunities.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-dd80fa5ebb19e9944238770f478851fb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9d1d825cd69dea8aed6d1651fb993c0c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d57f4dccb7b1de7c796c24d456b2c90f-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d57f4dccb7b1de7c796c24d456b2c90f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d8a71a5db941f76cbd976ed319daa4ce-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d8a71a5db941f76cbd976ed319daa4ce-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5b3691250d8034efc538f45153325e82-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5b3691250d8034efc538f45153325e82-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ccb6aa44b59c087ddbe71de229597bd4-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66bd77b51f9ea38a4762d65732ac21c9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b35a43e83892d75bc8e3746466c2bcfc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8047b6c93b09b89977542720f829a1da-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8047b6c93b09b89977542720f829a1da-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28e61b57c4ef53155963a0bdc0146d46-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28e61b57c4ef53155963a0bdc0146d46-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-495dc2d2fa3a0bb201cd26ebaa77ad10-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-495dc2d2fa3a0bb201cd26ebaa77ad10-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e3971755d02df1ca9d73a71e46dde1d7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7eff443bdc3f8249787b9d9ee690d679-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d9672c1c086c805dbb8f8962ec642b7a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e758367fdb2b5f6f0ba25e5351f06fae-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-219fb4a2de2e4f86f2a836460b2e4201-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-219fb4a2de2e4f86f2a836460b2e4201-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-219fb4a2de2e4f86f2a836460b2e4201-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a8496df2ccf7a2fedc35b83bd6c5e51-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a8496df2ccf7a2fedc35b83bd6c5e51-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4cbd3a65e3bbf220a047cbb226753147-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">htb-airtouch-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-bamboo-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-browsed-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-conversor-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-eighteen-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-gavel-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-giveback-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-guardian-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-imagery-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-pterodactyl-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-sorcery-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-soulmate-methodology.md</data>
