<node id="Wildcard Command Filter Bypass">
  <data key="d0">Wildcard Command Filter Bypass</data>
  <data key="d1">PayloadPattern</data>
  <data key="d2">Wildcard Command Filter Bypass is a malicious input technique designed to evade string filtering and pattern-based security mechanisms by utilizing wildcard characters or multiple path terminators. It typically involves constructing input in a reusable format that substitutes wildcards—such as asterisks or question marks—to represent alternative characters, thereby bypassing filters intended to block command execution. This method is commonly applied in command injection attacks, where the goal is to craft inputs that, upon processing, reach the underlying operating system and execute unintended or unauthorized commands within a shell environment. By leveraging ambiguous or multi-way path terminators within input fields, this bypass technique evades signature-based or regex-driven defenses meant to prevent malicious command construction. It may also function as a placeholder or test structure to probe the robustness of an application's input validation, aiming to expose vulnerabilities that allow operations beyond the intended scope. As a payload technique, it uses wildcard patterns or shell wildcard characters to circumvent restrictive command filters in input handling. Ultimately, Wildcard Command Filter Bypass undermines the integrity of security controls that rely on strict input validation to prevent unauthorized system access or command execution by appending wildcards and shell metacharacters in malicious input.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-dd80fa5ebb19e9944238770f478851fb-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8047b6c93b09b89977542720f829a1da-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9d1d825cd69dea8aed6d1651fb993c0c-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d193154c13a7545340d6aac7f93551ff-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-db51747d6e1553794dcbbc6d673eb1a6-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d8a71a5db941f76cbd976ed319daa4ce-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d8a71a5db941f76cbd976ed319daa4ce-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ccb6aa44b59c087ddbe71de229597bd4-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce55c93390355c438aad3e42f2558ea0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28e61b57c4ef53155963a0bdc0146d46-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28e61b57c4ef53155963a0bdc0146d46-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1e4ab66012df8871bd0b67c09233a063-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a539186415b267cf2fe68e024581d476-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a18d9206e0b44dc082a257441a96e79d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff53209713af43febf0054a8036e08a1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-da041acb6b82f70d6eea7e644d1ab933-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-da041acb6b82f70d6eea7e644d1ab933-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-219fb4a2de2e4f86f2a836460b2e4201-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c76c270a0e4b9c50447afdcbfd22aa1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-198b423c5fcf5fd72465af48d35436e5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f25479dd4ca15c3238c1385baf2d1e75-chunk-000</data>
