  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cracked Hash">
  <data key="d0">Cracked Hash</data>
  <data key="d1">Artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Cracked Hash refers to a decrypted or reconstructed password derived from a captured hash value through password-cracking techniques. This outcome signifies that an authentication weakness has been exploited, typically via offline or online cracking methods, where verification tests have matched the hash to a discovered plaintext credential. The existence of a cracked hash demonstrates successful password guessing or decryption, representing evidence of a successful brute-force attack. In essence, a cracked hash provides plaintext access to credentials that were previously stored or transmitted in hashed form, indicating that the original password security measures have been compromised by an attacker using decryption or guessing tools.&lt;SEP&gt;Evidence indicating that password hashing has been successfully reversed to expose plaintext credentials.&lt;SEP&gt;Decrypted password or hash revealing plaintext credentials or weak hashing schemes used in authentication.&lt;SEP&gt;A recovered or decrypted password hash resulting from an offline password cracking attempt.&lt;SEP&gt;Result indicating a password hash has been successfully decrypted to plain text.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9d1d825cd69dea8aed6d1651fb993c0c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9d1d825cd69dea8aed6d1651fb993c0c-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-db51747d6e1553794dcbbc6d673eb1a6-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-db51747d6e1553794dcbbc6d673eb1a6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66bd77b51f9ea38a4762d65732ac21c9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a267c575fd1175171a41707a2ac80c03-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8047b6c93b09b89977542720f829a1da-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6b1a9df875b4f4d10c856b106f068993-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6ee3143291e5ed56b99323040f30f7d7-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a539186415b267cf2fe68e024581d476-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7eff443bdc3f8249787b9d9ee690d679-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d9672c1c086c805dbb8f8962ec642b7a-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2af45459b5392b7945360d1fe34d952c-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f25479dd4ca15c3238c1385baf2d1e75-chunk-000</data>
