  <data key="d1">TechnologyStack</data>
  <data key="d2">A privileged administration interface reachable within the target scope.&lt;SEP&gt;An administrative user interface often hosted separately and prone to access control issues or misconfigurations.&lt;SEP&gt;A management interface within the application that provides elevated configuration or administration capabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;A reachable administrative section that is part of the application interface</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d193154c13a7545340d6aac7f93551ff-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28e61b57c4ef53155963a0bdc0146d46-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7eff443bdc3f8249787b9d9ee690d679-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-da041acb6b82f70d6eea7e644d1ab933-chunk-000</data>
