<node id="Localhost-Only Service">
  <data key="d0">Localhost-Only Service</data>
  <data key="d1">PreconditionEnvironment</data>
  <data key="d2">A service bound to localhost from within the network but reachable due to internal misconfigurations.&lt;SEP&gt;A target condition where a service binds exclusively to the loopback address (127.0.0.1), making it internally reachable without external exposure.&lt;SEP&gt;A backend service bound to the loopback interface and potentially reachable from the compromised host.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d193154c13a7545340d6aac7f93551ff-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-39047a18b515fcf5a6bcfa50dda4ee3a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e3971755d02df1ca9d73a71e46dde1d7-chunk-000</data>
