  <data key="d2">Web-based platform for source code management, often providing admin and API interfaces with authentication.&lt;SEP&gt;An online Git repository management service used for source code collaboration and version control hosting.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d193154c13a7545340d6aac7f93551ff-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d193154c13a7545340d6aac7f93551ff-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4cbd3a65e3bbf220a047cbb226753147-chunk-000</data>
