<node id="Obtain Account Access">
  <data key="d0">Obtain Account Access</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d193154c13a7545340d6aac7f93551ff-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-db51747d6e1553794dcbbc6d673eb1a6-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-db51747d6e1553794dcbbc6d673eb1a6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66bd77b51f9ea38a4762d65732ac21c9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66bd77b51f9ea38a4762d65732ac21c9-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d2">The technique may allow an attacker to gain unauthorized user access.&lt;SEP&gt;To retrieve valid credentials used to authenticate on a target system.&lt;SEP&gt;The objective of capturing valid user credentials or obtaining session tokens to blend in with legitimate users.&lt;SEP&gt;An objective to retrieve or steal valid user credentials and session tokens.</data>
