<node id="Time Delay">
  <data key="d0">Time Delay</data>
  <data key="d1">ObservableSignal</data>
  <data key="d2">A measurable latency or response time indicating backend processing or backend network activity.&lt;SEP&gt;Variable execution time within a server response that correlates with brute-force attempts or secondary backend calls.&lt;SEP&gt;Observable evidence of a network or computational lag introduced by query execution methods such as time-based inference techniques.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-db51747d6e1553794dcbbc6d673eb1a6-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-db51747d6e1553794dcbbc6d673eb1a6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7eff443bdc3f8249787b9d9ee690d679-chunk-001</data>
