</node>
<node id="ASP.NET">
  <data key="d0">ASP.NET</data>
  <data key="d1">TechnologyStack</data>
  <data key="d2">A web application framework and developer platform from Microsoft used to build web applications deployed on IIS.&lt;SEP&gt;A server-side web application framework built on the .NET platform, typically hosted on IIS.&lt;SEP&gt;A framework for building web applications using .NET.&lt;SEP&gt;A server-side web application framework running on IIS.&lt;SEP&gt;Microsoft web application framework used within the target service stack.&lt;SEP&gt;ASP.NET web application framework used by one or more web services.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-db51747d6e1553794dcbbc6d673eb1a6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-136da9e7ebc65a69c7a4923c2daacd7b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66bd77b51f9ea38a4762d65732ac21c9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1e4ab66012df8871bd0b67c09233a063-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1e4ab66012df8871bd0b67c09233a063-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a539186415b267cf2fe68e024581d476-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff53209713af43febf0054a8036e08a1-chunk-000</data>
