<node id="IIS">
  <data key="d0">IIS</data>
  <data key="d1">TechnologyStack</data>
  <data key="d2">Internet Information Services, a web server and reverse proxy created by Microsoft used to host and serve web applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Internet Information Services: Microsoft's web server platform commonly hosting ASP.NET applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Microsoft Internet Information Services web server.&lt;SEP&gt;A Windows Internet Information Services web server hosting applications and providing HTTP services.&lt;SEP&gt;Internet Information Services web server running on the target environment.&lt;SEP&gt;Internet Information Services hosting web applications and API endpoints.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-db51747d6e1553794dcbbc6d673eb1a6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-136da9e7ebc65a69c7a4923c2daacd7b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66bd77b51f9ea38a4762d65732ac21c9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1e4ab66012df8871bd0b67c09233a063-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1e4ab66012df8871bd0b67c09233a063-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a539186415b267cf2fe68e024581d476-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff53209713af43febf0054a8036e08a1-chunk-000</data>
