  <data key="d0">MSSQL</data>
  <data key="d1">TechnologyStack</data>
  <data key="d2">A relational database management system developed by Microsoft used for storing and retrieving data accessed by application layers.&lt;SEP&gt;Microsoft SQL Server relational database management system.&lt;SEP&gt;Microsoft SQL Server database service present in the environment.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-db51747d6e1553794dcbbc6d673eb1a6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ccb6aa44b59c087ddbe71de229597bd4-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66bd77b51f9ea38a4762d65732ac21c9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff53209713af43febf0054a8036e08a1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c76c270a0e4b9c50447afdcbfd22aa1-chunk-002</data>
