<node id="SQL Injection Enumeration">
  <data key="d0">SQL Injection Enumeration</data>
  <data key="d1">AttackTechnique</data>
  <data key="d2">A testing action that injects malicious SQL queries to enumerate database structure and data through boolean responses, time delays, and comment bypasses.&lt;SEP&gt;An active probing action that uses structured queries to discover database schema, data, and server responses.&lt;SEP&gt;Technique that injects malicious SQL to extract data bit-by-bit through server responses (e.g., boolean or time delays).</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-39047a18b515fcf5a6bcfa50dda4ee3a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-39047a18b515fcf5a6bcfa50dda4ee3a-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a8496df2ccf7a2fedc35b83bd6c5e51-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a8496df2ccf7a2fedc35b83bd6c5e51-chunk-002</data>
