</node>
<node id="JWT Secret Weakness">
  <data key="d0">JWT Secret Weakness</data>
  <data key="d1">VulnerabilityClass</data>
  <data key="d2">JWT Secret Weakness refers to a security vulnerability arising from the improper handling, exposure, or protection of the cryptographic secret key required to sign or verify JSON Web Tokens. This flaw encompasses scenarios where secrets are stored insecurely in error logs, exposed as environment variables, or hard-coded within application code, thereby making them discoverable to attackers. Such weaknesses enable adversaries to forge or manipulate valid JWTs by gaining access to the signing or verification secret. This technical vulnerability is further characterized by inadequate secrecy practices, insecure key rotation, or flawed validation mechanisms that fail to verify the integrity of the cryptographic key used during token issuance or authentication. Ultimately, a JWT secret weakness undermines the fundamental trust and authenticity guarantees provided by token-based authentication systems.&lt;SEP&gt;A vulnerability class where misconfigured JWT secrets enable token forgery or content tampering.&lt;SEP&gt;Improper handling or exposure of the secret key used to sign or verify JWT tokens.&lt;SEP&gt;A flaw in the handling or storage of the JWT signing secret&lt;SEP&gt;Weakness in handling, storage, or signature validation of JSON Web Token secrets.&lt;SEP&gt;Weakness related to inadequate protection, predictable values, or leakage of the signing key used to create or validate JSON web tokens.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-39047a18b515fcf5a6bcfa50dda4ee3a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5b3691250d8034efc538f45153325e82-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce55c93390355c438aad3e42f2558ea0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e60bdd5f7d1090f66c283ab2ebd04906-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e60bdd5f7d1090f66c283ab2ebd04906-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-495dc2d2fa3a0bb201cd26ebaa77ad10-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-495dc2d2fa3a0bb201cd26ebaa77ad10-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6ee3143291e5ed56b99323040f30f7d7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a539186415b267cf2fe68e024581d476-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a18d9206e0b44dc082a257441a96e79d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a18d9206e0b44dc082a257441a96e79d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e758367fdb2b5f6f0ba25e5351f06fae-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e758367fdb2b5f6f0ba25e5351f06fae-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-da041acb6b82f70d6eea7e644d1ab933-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-da041acb6b82f70d6eea7e644d1ab933-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-219fb4a2de2e4f86f2a836460b2e4201-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a8496df2ccf7a2fedc35b83bd6c5e51-chunk-000</data>
