<node id="Windows Command-Line Interface">
  <data key="d0">Windows Command-Line Interface</data>
  <data key="d1">TechnologyStack</data>
  <data key="d2">A low-level command-line shell environment (such as CMD or PowerShell) on Windows operating systems where commands are executed from text input.</data>
