<edge source="WinRM Credential Login" target="Escalate Privileges">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">WinRM Credential Login is used to achieve the strategic objective of raising a user's privilege level beyond initial account permissions on the target system.&lt;SEP&gt;Once authenticated, the attacker can execute privilege escalation commands to gain higher system permissions.&lt;SEP&gt;Provides authenticated access used to pivot up or exploit misconfigurations for full control.&lt;SEP&gt;The capability helps attackers gain higher system access levels.</data>
