  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Targets accessible upload handlers for depositing malicious webshells.&lt;SEP&gt;The attack goal depends on the upload functionality to write and serve executable artifacts to the web server.&lt;SEP&gt;Uses a vulnerable upload endpoint to deliver and host malicious scripts for command execution.&lt;SEP&gt;Uses the upload handler to deliver and write down malicious executable shellcodes.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique leverages an accessible upload component to upload malicious payloads that are executed server-side.</data>
