<edge source="Executable Upload Webshell" target="Execute Code">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Executable Upload Webshell enables an attacker to achieve the attack goal of running arbitrary malicious commands or scripts within the context of the web server environment.&lt;SEP&gt;Technique enables code execution by deploying a web shell accepted by the application.</data>
