  <data key="d12">1785757729</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Executable Upload Webshell" target="Escalate Privileges">
  <data key="d7">16.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Escalate Privileges through Executable Upload Webshell is a privilege escalation technique in which an attacker uploads a web shell onto a target server. By injecting an executable script into the web server environment, the attacker establishes a persistent foothold that resides within the web context but can escape to execute commands at higher privilege levels. Once established, this web shell enables the attacker to run privileged commands, spawn processes with elevated system permissions, or utilize the compromised system to follow additional privilege escalation paths. This uploaded implant serves as a critical pivot point from the limited web server account to broader access over the entire host. The technique often leverages misconfigurations or weaknesses in user privilege models to achieve higher-level control over system resources. Consequently, a webshell can facilitate achieving root or administrative-level access on the compromised host, permit advancing privileges within the environment, provide a persistent access path for further attacks, and act as an artifact enabling privilege escalation objectives. Ultimately, uploading such a webshell allows attackers to run commands with higher privileges than initially granted upon initial compromise, aligning with the attacker's goal of gaining higher system privileges by dropping or running shell access with elevated local or system-level permissions.&lt;SEP&gt;Facilitates privilege escalation by providing a persistent shell with elevated or system-level permissions.</data>
  <data key="d9">Supports,can support,can support attack goal,can support goal,supports,supports attack goal</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-0a5b62addae42b2d3e684b41ed40260e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dd80fa5ebb19e9944238770f478851fb-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9d1d825cd69dea8aed6d1651fb993c0c-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-136da9e7ebc65a69c7a4923c2daacd7b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5b3691250d8034efc538f45153325e82-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ccb6aa44b59c087ddbe71de229597bd4-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66bd77b51f9ea38a4762d65732ac21c9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1e4ab66012df8871bd0b67c09233a063-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a539186415b267cf2fe68e024581d476-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7eff443bdc3f8249787b9d9ee690d679-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a18d9206e0b44dc082a257441a96e79d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff53209713af43febf0054a8036e08a1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2af45459b5392b7945360d1fe34d952c-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9756198566adacc24b429de0c91a0beb-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-198b423c5fcf5fd72465af48d35436e5-chunk-002</data>
