<edge source="Executable Upload Webshell" target="Credentials">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Successful execution of a webshell can lead to the acquisition of valid user credentials.&lt;SEP&gt;Technique can result in harvesting of valid user credentials from the web shell instance or target environment.&lt;SEP&gt;The uploaded web shell can facilitate obtaining target credentials.&lt;SEP&gt;The successful upload of a webshell often grants access to authentication files, database configs, or keys residing on the server.</data>
