  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="JWT Token Forgery" target="Database Dump">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Can provide unauthorized access to full database contents if authenticated via the forged token.&lt;SEP&gt;Successful token forgery can enable requests to database endpoints to retrieve sensitive data, resulting in an artifact containing an extraction of the database schema or records.&lt;SEP&gt;Successful forgery may lead to unauthorized database access or dump extraction.&lt;SEP&gt;Successful forgery may yield access or extraction resulting in database dumps.&lt;SEP&gt;The attack may yield a full or partial database schema and data dump when tokens are abused to spoof legitimate user privileges for data export.&lt;SEP&gt;Manipulated tokens may enable downloading sensitive data like a full database dump.</data>
