<edge source="JWT Token Forgery" target="Reachable Login Workflow">
  <data key="d7">11.0</data>
  <data key="d8">JWT Token Forgery via Reachable Login Workflow is a technique that relies on exploiting an existing login or authentication mechanism to compromise token integrity. The attack begins with establishing access to a functioning login workflow, which is a critical precondition to execute the forgery successfully. Once the login endpoint is reachable, an attacker can intercept or manipulate the authentication process to generate a forged JWT that mimics a legitimate token. This fraudulent token is then used to gain unauthorized access to protected resources by leveraging the application’s trust in properly issued JWTs. The core of the vulnerability lies in the requirement of a reachable authentication flow—without which the forgery process cannot proceed. Whether the goal is to alter claims, manipulate the token signature, or sidestep authorization checks, the presence of a viable login workflow is indispensable to obtain, test, or bypass token validation mechanisms effectively.&lt;SEP&gt;Uses input or metadata from a reachable login flow to forge valid-looking tokens.&lt;SEP&gt;When a login workflow is present, forged JWTs can be used in subsequent requests to bypass authentication checks.&lt;SEP&gt;The attack targets a login flow where JWT tokens are issued or validated upon user authentication.</data>
  <data key="d9">applicable when,applies when,exploits,requires,targets</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-d193154c13a7545340d6aac7f93551ff-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d8a71a5db941f76cbd976ed319daa4ce-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5b3691250d8034efc538f45153325e82-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ccb6aa44b59c087ddbe71de229597bd4-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ccb6aa44b59c087ddbe71de229597bd4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e60bdd5f7d1090f66c283ab2ebd04906-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a539186415b267cf2fe68e024581d476-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-da041acb6b82f70d6eea7e644d1ab933-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c76c270a0e4b9c50447afdcbfd22aa1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c76c270a0e4b9c50447afdcbfd22aa1-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9756198566adacc24b429de0c91a0beb-chunk-000</data>
