  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Successful token manipulation may create a route for higher privilege levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Compromised authorization tokens bypass access control, allowing elevation to higher privileges.&lt;SEP&gt;Malicious tokens with modified claims may elevate user access scope to admin level.&lt;SEP&gt;Successful forgery creates a path to elevate user rights.</data>
