<edge source="JWT Token Forgery" target="JWT Secret Weakness">
  <data key="d7">7.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The technique attempts to forge tokens by targeting vulnerabilities in the secret or signing process.&lt;SEP&gt;Uses known or guessed weaknesses in the JWT secret to forge valid tokens bypassing authorization checks.&lt;SEP&gt;The attack technique leverages insufficient protection of the signing secret to generate valid tokens without legitimate credential possession.&lt;SEP&gt;Attack technique targets and leverages JWT secret weakness for unauthorized token creation.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique leverages weaknesses related to the handling or exposure of the signing secret.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique exploits flaws in retrieving or protecting the JSON Web Token secret.&lt;SEP&gt;Weak or insufficient handling of the secret key enables forgery of valid-looking tokens.</data>
