<edge source="Shell Access" target="Privilege Escalation Path">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Shell access provides the capability and environment needed to follow the privilege escalation path.&lt;SEP&gt;A shell is often a prerequisite to perform steps that increase user privileges.&lt;SEP&gt;Existing shell access facilitates execution of further commands to progress privilege escalation.&lt;SEP&gt;A shell provides an interactive environment allowing the attacker to perform subsequent steps to gain higher privileges.</data>
