  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Escalate Privileges" target="SSRF Localhost Probing">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The technique can assist in gaining higher-level access on the target.&lt;SEP&gt;When preconditions are met, the technique can assist with privilege escalation within the network.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique can facilitate privilege escalation through internal service discovery.&lt;SEP&gt;This technique helps achieve the strategic outcome of privilege escalation.</data>
  <data key="d9">supports</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-d57f4dccb7b1de7c796c24d456b2c90f-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-39047a18b515fcf5a6bcfa50dda4ee3a-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e60bdd5f7d1090f66c283ab2ebd04906-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4cbd3a65e3bbf220a047cbb226753147-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d11">htb-browsed-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-cctv-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-facts-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;htb-soulmate-methodology.md</data>
