  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Escalate Privileges" target="SQL Injection File Read">
  <data key="d7">7.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The technique can be used to elevate user privileges via the database.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique enables elevation of user rights or system access.&lt;SEP&gt;Successful file retrieval can provide system configuration files or privilege escalation details that pave the way to higher-privilege access.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique can provide access to files containing credentials or configuration that aid in privilege escalation.&lt;SEP&gt;Reading local configuration files may reveal paths or details useful for gaining higher-level permissions.&lt;SEP&gt;Facilitates privilege escalation by reading configuration or system files that hold elevated or administrative details.&lt;SEP&gt;This technique contributes to the attacker goal of gaining higher system privileges.</data>
  <data key="d9">can support attack goal,supports</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-d57f4dccb7b1de7c796c24d456b2c90f-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d8a71a5db941f76cbd976ed319daa4ce-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce55c93390355c438aad3e42f2558ea0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a267c575fd1175171a41707a2ac80c03-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8047b6c93b09b89977542720f829a1da-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c76c270a0e4b9c50447afdcbfd22aa1-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2af45459b5392b7945360d1fe34d952c-chunk-001</data>
