<edge source="Credentials" target="Privilege Escalation Path">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Credentials provide the valid identity needed to elevate access or pivot through the network after initial breach.&lt;SEP&gt;Obtained or discovered credentials facilitate authenticating to higher-privilege contexts or database accounts for proceeding up the chain.&lt;SEP&gt;Extracted credentials may provide the necessary access to escalate permissions or switch user contexts.</data>
