<edge source="Credentials" target="SSRF Localhost Probing">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The attack can extract authentication details or session tokens from iterated directories or endpoints.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique can exfiltrate stored or session credentials discovered via internal service misconfiguration.</data>
