<edge source="Credentials" target="Offline Password Cracking">
  <data key="d7">11.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Credentials Offline Password Cracking describes a process where manual or automated techniques are employed to extract plaintext username and password pairs from password hash artifacts. This attack method relies on input data containing captured credential information, utilizing brute-force or dictionary attacks to find the matching plaintext credentials corresponding to the hashes. The successful outcome of this relation results in the discovery and extraction of previously hashed or obscured credentials, yielding complete username and password pairs that are no longer encrypted. These extracted plaintext credentials are then generated or discovered and subsequently used to facilitate further exploitation. The core objective of such cracking is to produce valid password credentials from cryptographic hash outputs for unauthorized access or subsequent malicious activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Generates or recovers usable credentials that can later be used to authenticate directly within the system.&lt;SEP&gt;Outputs usernames and passwords extracted from successfully cracked hashes.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique results in obtaining user credentials as artifacts.</data>
  <data key="d9">extracts,produces,uses as input</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-39047a18b515fcf5a6bcfa50dda4ee3a-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5b3691250d8034efc538f45153325e82-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5b3691250d8034efc538f45153325e82-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ccb6aa44b59c087ddbe71de229597bd4-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66bd77b51f9ea38a4762d65732ac21c9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28e61b57c4ef53155963a0bdc0146d46-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6b1a9df875b4f4d10c856b106f068993-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7eff443bdc3f8249787b9d9ee690d679-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9756198566adacc24b429de0c91a0beb-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4cbd3a65e3bbf220a047cbb226753147-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f25479dd4ca15c3238c1385baf2d1e75-chunk-000</data>
