<edge source="SQL Injection File Read" target="Accessible API Endpoint">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">API endpoints are exploited to perform file reading operations outside the database through backend SQL interfaces.&lt;SEP&gt;Multiple API endpoints exposed to user input that interface with the underlying database or filesystem increase the attack surface.&lt;SEP&gt;API endpoints that accept parameters used in SQL queries are the primary attack surface for reading files.&lt;SEP&gt;Focuses attacks on API endpoints to read files via database queries.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique targets API endpoints reachable via SQL injection for file read operations.</data>
