<edge source="Reachable Login Workflow" target="Offline Password Cracking">
  <data key="d7">13.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Offline Password Cracking, Reachable Login Workflow — This relation describes a threat model wherein attackers attempt to crack compromised credentials offline using a reachable login system to validate their results. The technique hinges on the availability of a login workflow—specifically, an interactive login endpoint or form that accepts user credentials for authentication. Key preconditions include access to a reachable login interface, which allows attackers to submit test credentials during brute-force or dictionary attacks on password hashes already obtained elsewhere. The workflow involves testing cracked login data by submitting it through this endpoint, enabling attackers to confirm valid credentials without real-time network interaction with a server storing password hashes. Consequently, this relation is only relevant when a login endpoint is accessible and able to process authentication requests, making it a critical factor in the success of post-exploitation credential validation and lateral movement strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;When there is an active login workflow reachable by an attacker and credentials captured from that workflow.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique requires an accessible login workflow to retrieve credentials for offline processing.&lt;SEP&gt;Requires the presence of a login page or form accepting credential submissions to test discovered hashes.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique needs a valid login interface to receive and respond to authentication attempts or crafted payloads.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique requires an existing login interface that can be interacted with.</data>
  <data key="d9">applicable when,applies when,requires</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-dd80fa5ebb19e9944238770f478851fb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d8a71a5db941f76cbd976ed319daa4ce-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ccb6aa44b59c087ddbe71de229597bd4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e60bdd5f7d1090f66c283ab2ebd04906-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6b1a9df875b4f4d10c856b106f068993-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-495dc2d2fa3a0bb201cd26ebaa77ad10-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a539186415b267cf2fe68e024581d476-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7eff443bdc3f8249787b9d9ee690d679-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c76c270a0e4b9c50447afdcbfd22aa1-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2af45459b5392b7945360d1fe34d952c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9756198566adacc24b429de0c91a0beb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9756198566adacc24b429de0c91a0beb-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f25479dd4ca15c3238c1385baf2d1e75-chunk-000</data>
