<edge source="SSRF Localhost Probing" target="Server-Side URL Fetch Feature">
  <data key="d7">17.0</data>
  <data key="d8">SSRF Localhost Probing, also known as Server-Side URL Fetch Feature exploitation, is a web security attack technique that abuses a server's built-in functionality to fetch resources from provided URLs. By injecting crafted URLs containing localhost addresses or other internal network paths into user input parameters, attackers coerce the server into acting as a probing tool to discover reachability and response patterns of services that are intended to be accessible only within the local machine or private network. This core mechanism leverages the server's ability to generate outbound HTTP or HTTPS requests based on user-supplied input, effectively translating the server itself into an instrument for reconnaissance against otherwise hidden internal interfaces or unprotected backend systems. The attack hinges on the server dynamically fetching URLs derived from untrusted input contexts—such as query strings, headers, or body payloads—thereby bypassing access controls and subverting the intended network segmentation designed to shield internal resources.&lt;SEP&gt;This feature provides the mechanism to make outbound requests to internal services for probing.&lt;SEP&gt;The server-side URL fetch capability is abused to contact local services by crafting malicious or crafted URLs.</data>
  <data key="d9">abuses,applicable when,applies when,exploits,is used for,leverages,relies on,requires,uses</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-dd80fa5ebb19e9944238770f478851fb-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d193154c13a7545340d6aac7f93551ff-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d57f4dccb7b1de7c796c24d456b2c90f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d57f4dccb7b1de7c796c24d456b2c90f-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-39047a18b515fcf5a6bcfa50dda4ee3a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b35a43e83892d75bc8e3746466c2bcfc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8047b6c93b09b89977542720f829a1da-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-495dc2d2fa3a0bb201cd26ebaa77ad10-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a539186415b267cf2fe68e024581d476-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a18d9206e0b44dc082a257441a96e79d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d9672c1c086c805dbb8f8962ec642b7a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff53209713af43febf0054a8036e08a1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ff53209713af43febf0054a8036e08a1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-219fb4a2de2e4f86f2a836460b2e4201-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a8496df2ccf7a2fedc35b83bd6c5e51-chunk-000</data>
