<edge source="Name-Based Virtual Host Routing" target="Virtual Host Discovery">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The discovery technique utilizes virtual host functionality to probe for backend resources.&lt;SEP&gt;Exploits the server’s behavior to resolve and reveal other bound virtual host names based on user-controlled host headers.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique requires name-based routing configuration present in the hosting environment.&lt;SEP&gt;The hosting mechanism directs based on hostname requests to discover backend hostnames.&lt;SEP&gt;The technique identifies additional virtual host configurations by manipulating HTTP Host headers when routing is enabled.</data>
